lass=\"fn\">P</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value of `foldUInPlace3R` for a step with a linear law, as `foldUInPlace2_spec` with a third\nlimb read and a multiplier `uo` of the limb written: if every step turns limbs `x`, `y`, `z` and\nthe accumulator `c` into a limb `out` and an accumulator `c'` with\n`uo out + 2ʷ P c' + ux x + uy y + uz z + Q c = vx x + vy y + vz z + 2ʷ Q c' + P c`, then the\nwindow written and the last accumulator satisfy the same law with the values of the windows, as\nlong as the windows read are not overwritten before they are read.","docLink":"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace3R_spec","kind":"theorem","line":1279,"name":"MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace3R_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/WordArray.lean#L1279-L1375"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace3RThen\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">WordArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldUInPlace3RThen</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<s