> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">b₁</span> <span class=\"fn\">b₂</span> <span class=\"fn\">b₃</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a>                   <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">P₃</span> <span class=\"fn\">b₃</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The values of `foldUInPlace3`, for steps with linear carry laws: if every step of `fᵢ` turns a limb\n`z` and an accumulator `c` into a limb `out` and an accumulator `c'` with\n`out + 2ʷ Pᵢ c' + Eᵢ j + Qᵢ c = z + Gᵢ j + 2ʷ Qᵢ c' + Pᵢ c`, then the windows satisfy the same law\nwith the sums of the amounts `Eᵢ` and `Gᵢ`, as long as the three windows are disjoint. `Pᵢ` is a\ncarry and `Qᵢ` a borrow.","docLink":"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace3_spec","kind":"theorem","line":843,"name":"MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace3_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/WordArray.lean#L843-L986"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.wsum_add_mul\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">WordArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">wsum_add_mul</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">g </span><span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">v </span><span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.wsum\">wsum</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span> <span class=\"fn\">(fun (<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">g</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">h</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span></span>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.wsum\">wsum</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span> <span class=\"fn\">g</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">v</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.wsum\">wsum</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span> <span class=\"fn\">h</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`wsum` is linear in its digits.","docLink":"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.wsum_add_mul","kind":"theorem","line":825,"name":"MPN.WordArray.wsum_add_mul","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/WordArray.lean#L825-L832"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.wsum_zero\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">WordArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">wsum_zero</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">w </span><span class=\"fn\">j </span><span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Na