y.html#MPN.LimbArray.valAt\">LimbArray.valAt</a> <span class=\"fn\">arr</span> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">ys</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>) (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a>             <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray.w\">LimbArray.w</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">j</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)) <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">Q</span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace2\">foldUInPlace2</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">f</span> <span class=\"fn\">arr</span> <span class=\"fn\">rs</span> <span class=\"fn\">xs</span> <span class=\"fn\">ys</span> <span class=\"fn\">hr</span> <span class=\"fn\">hx</span> <span class=\"fn\">hy</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.snd\">snd</a></span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a>           <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">P</span> <span class=\"fn\">b</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value of `foldUInPlace2` for a step with a linear carry law: if every step turns limbs `x`,\n`y` and the accumulator `c` into a limb `out` and an accumulator `c'` with\n`out + 2ʷ P c' + ux x + uy y + Q c = vx x + vy y + 2ʷ Q c' + P c` and keeps the invariant `I` of\nthe accumulator, then the limbs written and the last accumulator satisfy the same law with the\nvalues of the windows, as long as the windows read are not overwritten before they are read. `P`\nis a carry and `Q` a borrow.","docLink":"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace2_spec","kind":"theorem","line":476,"name":"MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace2_spec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/WordArray.lean#L476-L567"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.foldUInPlace2Then\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">WordArray</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldUInPlace2Then</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A </span><span class=\"fn\">L</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">LA</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/LimbArray.html#MPN.LimbArray\">LimbArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">R</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray\">WordArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">L</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β </span><span class=\"fn\">γ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">T